# The php-paths example after php-paths.tsc: PATHS through the same line again, now that FLOW
# remembers runs that went through the event dispatcher to the listener, which no language
# server sees: the invoice's path straight to the helper marked, the one through the listener
# marked too, and the cursor on the service, where the two part.
@wait stop
/bp clear
/find Money.php:16
@key enter
/paths
@wait paths
@key m
@key j j j m
@key k k k k
@dump paths.ans
